data: {"id": "4418929b0c4446e2-thinking-parallel_evidence-118", "run_id": "4418929b0c4446e2", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我将根据 layer_handoff 的结果，对 `aiops-case-v17/workload` Pod 进行根因调查。\n\n### 1. 初步证据采集：Pod 状态与生命周期\n\n首先获取 Pod 的详细描述和最近的事件，以确认其生命周期状态和 Crash 的具体 Exit Code。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789394615897, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

