data: {"id": "4418929b0c4446e2-thinking-parallel_evidence-679", "run_id": "4418929b0c4446e2", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已有的 kubectl_events 和 kubectl_describe 结果，当前实体状态与冲突如下：\n\n### 1. 实体身份确认\n*   **Pod**: `aiops-case-v17/workload`\n*   **UID**: `85aece07-6ffa-41db-9e5a-f351771a8864`\n*   **当前状态**: `CrashLoopBackOff`\n*   **容器**: `app` (镜像: `python:3-alpine`)\n\n### 2. 支持候选原因的证据（CrashLoopBackOff）\n*   **重启风暴**: 容器已重启 23 次。\n*   **退出码**: 容器最后一次状态为 `Terminated (Error, Exit Code 137)`。\n*   **Killing 事件**: 频繁触发 `Container app failed liveness probe, will be restarted`。\n\n### 3. 冲突与未决点\n*   **Exit Code 137 的歧义**: 137 (SIGKILL) 通常", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789394640830, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

